<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <title>Reset your password</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f4f4f7; padding: 24px;">
  <div style="max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 32px;">
    <h2 style="color: #1a1a1a;">Reset your password</h2>
    <p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>
    <p>We received a request to reset the password for your account. Click the button below to choose a new one:</p>
    <p style="text-align: center; margin: 24px 0;">
      <a href="<%= resetUrl %>" style="background: #e0a526; color: #1a1a1a; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 24px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block;">Choose a new password</a>
    </p>
    <p>This link works once and expires in <%= expiresInMinutes %> minutes.</p>
    <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #666;">If the button doesn't work, copy this address into your browser:<br /><%= resetUrl %></p>
    <p>If you didn't ask for this, you can safely ignore this email - your password won't change.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
